{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sc59761d33514dfaf","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-893726ccadf7259114a2","text":"[開拓者]、おるか！！！！","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e3e106da8d7cb941376b","text":"どうしてそんなに慌ててる{F#の}{M#んだ}？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-4987dfe1bb36aac496bb","text":"何か大事件でも起きたの{F#}{M#か}？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-ce52abeda57687507f1c","text":"慌てないで","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-cdc1c8bd789252c09e91","text":"落ち着いて。ゆっくり話して","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-6321a7030d611036bd6f","text":"超緊急の用事じゃ","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e7975f5f4d169e306c96","text":"考えるのすら怖いんじゃが","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-36186f9c60d2ac235a24","text":"超超久しぶりに、列車の大掃除の日がやって来るのじゃあああああ","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-7d2535d6684b47134bdd","text":"…えっ？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-94d52e5df89284208354","text":"分かった","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-0dce15be793c473d34c8","text":"一緒に掃除をしてほしいってことだ{F#ね}{M#な}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-6a3c2ab7fc37408b53d1","text":"じゃが、[開拓者]が手伝ってくれるなら、オレも大歓迎じゃ！","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-fe21d4243683bfb740c9","text":"すぐに最寄りの洗車星に向かうぞ","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-f20f82ad6c2c2d1d1b74","text":"時間がある時に戻ってくるんじゃぞ","speaker":"パム"}]}
